  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WePeace: Women&apos;s Agency in Keeping the Peace, Promoting Security - Year 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WePeace is a capacity sharing project on gender-responsive peacemaking and peacekeeping for community women in conflict-affected areas. It has helped implement some action points in the current National Action Plan on UNSCR 1325 - Women, Peace and Security, including capacitation of women from conflict-affected/vulnerable communities on peace under the Pillar on Empowerment and Participation. Four Areas, Four Conflict Lines: In 2019, WePeace has helped capacitate a total of 83 women from four different areas with four different conflict lines, this project continues with the gains of Year 1 programming.</narrative>
  </description>
